## 3. Konfigurace (`appsettings.json`)

```json
{
  "ConnectionStrings": {
    "{{DB1}}": "Server=...;Database={{DB1}};...",
    "{{DB2}}": "..."
  },
  "{{ConnectorName}}": {
    "BatchSize": 1000,
    "MaxRetries": 3,
    "TimeoutSec": 30
  }
}
```

| Klíč | Význam | Default |
|---|---|---|
| `BatchSize` | Velikost dávky pro bulk operace | 1000 |
| `MaxRetries` | Max počet pokusů per task | 3 |
| `TimeoutSec` | HTTP timeout | 30 |

